# The angular stack's build context: base/ and the tasks on this stack, nothing
# else. A task on this stack is named angular-*, which is what admits it here
# and keeps it out of the root .dockerignore's modern warm-up. BuildKit reads this file instead of the root .dockerignore because it
# sits beside base/angular.Dockerfile and carries its name.
*
!base/
!tasks/angular-*/

**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/.DS_Store
